OL,3,GNEWSABeloved railway station cat dies
OL,4,Ain road accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA black cat which graced the platforms
OL,7,Fof Huddersfield Railway Station for
OL,8,Fmore than five years has died in a road
OL,9,Faccident, it has been confirmed.
OL,11,FBolt was first seen at the West
OL,12,FYorkshire station in 2019 and soon won
OL,13,Fthousands of fans, becoming a social
OL,14,Fmedia sensation. A Facebook page set up
OL,15,Ffor him and his sidekick Felix gained
OL,16,Fmore than 167,000 followers.
OL,18,FHe left the station last year when
OL,19,Fengineering works meant it was better
OL,20,Ffor him to be rehomed with his "station
OL,21,Fmum" Jacqui.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
