OL,3,GNEWSABeloved railway station cat dies
OL,4,Ain road accident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA post on the Facebook page said he had
OL,7,Fdied in an accident last week. It said:
OL,8,F"Bolt may have left the station many
OL,9,Fmoons ago, but he never left the hearts
OL,10,Fof the people who knew and loved him."
